		{"id":"db9f91fb783a2903","type":"text","text":"# Ite Overview\nIt's XX87. It's been XXX years since the world flooded over, drowning humanity and leaving Jellyfish to rule the world in their wake. \n\nWe look at a futuristic Japan buried underneath the sea, following a human girl named Ponyo Shinawa (心泡ポニョ) as she navigates life at the super prestigious international school in Kyoto, Japan. \n\nWill she get out alive? And will she ever find the fabled *Jellyfish Love*?\n","x":-600,"y":-80,"width":455,"height":400},
